# Build switches read by `autophys build-web`. Copy to html/.env (gitignored)
# to change them for your own builds; the build's environment overrides it.
#
# TENTO_APP_SWITCHER: `on` bundles an app switcher into the header (a chevron
# after the Autophys mark that opens a card of related apps) from
# html/app-switcher.json, also gitignored. Off by default, so a clone of this
# repository builds without it; with the switch on and no manifest, nothing
# is bundled either.
#
# html/app-switcher.json is a manifest in the format of tento-web's
# AppSwitcherPlugin: the apps in grid order with their ids, names, links and
# tile icons (svg files or inline svg), an optional label for the chevron,
# an optional footer link, and optional light and dark colour tokens.
# Autophys marks the app with id `autophys` as current and uses the light
# tokens. A host that packages a switcher supplies its own copy; nothing in
# this repository describes which apps it lists.
#
# tento-web's bundler (vendor/tento/tento-web-js/build-plugins/app-switcher.deno.ts)
# reads both files during the build and replaces
# @tento-brand/kit/app-switcher.packaged with the result;
# html/routes/app-switcher.ts mounts it on the header's brand link.
# TENTO_APP_SWITCHER=on
#
# AUTOPHYS_HOSTED_BADGE: `on` bundles a small pill above the landing's docs
# naming the event Autophys was built for, with a link to its page. The copy
# is in html/routes/hosted-badge.switched.ts; tento-web's BuildSwitchPlugin
# (vendor/tento/tento-web-js/build-plugins/build-switch.deno.ts) bundles that
# module as written only with the switch on, and `null` otherwise, so with the
# switch off or unset neither the pill nor its text or link is in the build.
# Off by default, so a clone of this repository builds without it.
# AUTOPHYS_HOSTED_BADGE=on
